  "specialRules": "One Missile Weapon: Every warrior in an Outlaws warband may carry only one missile weapon at any time, even if a skill would normally allow more. | Bows for All: Every warrior must carry some type of bow (not a crossbow) as part of their equipment. The only exception is the Cleric, who may carry a bow but does not have to. | Heroes Only Equipment: The Long Bow and all miscellaneous equipment (Forest Cloak 45 gc, Hunting Arrows 30 gc) may only be bought by Heroes. | Forest Cloak: Rare 10, Outlaws only. While the wearer is beside a tree, bush or hedge, enemies shooting at him suffer an additional -1 to hit, and a spellcaster may only target him with a spell after rolling 4+ on a D6. This does not apply if the shooter or caster is within the wearer's Initiative value in inches. | Cleric: The warband may include one Cleric, but only in place of a Champion or a Petty Thief."
